s** New plugins platform.","target":"{{< relref \"#plugins-platform\" >}}","line":17},{"title":"**Tutorials** New tutorials section.","target":"{{< relref \"#new-tutorials\" >}}","line":18},{"title":"**Cloudwatch** Support for Cloudwatch Logs in Explore and the Logs panel.","target":"{{< relref \"#cloudwatch-logs\" >}}","line":19},{"title":"**Breaking change** PhantomJS removed.","target":"{{< relref \"#breaking-change---phantomjs-removed\" >}}","line":20},{"title":"**Time zones** Time zone support","target":"{{< relref \"#time-zone-support\" >}}","line":21}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
